{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And saw.</b> This event was after the section of \"See, you say to me\" (Exodus 12 [sic]); for it was during the forty days that he prostrated himself over the matter of the calf, and afterward he came down and shattered the tablets. Then HaShem passed before him, and what He had said to him, \"and you shall see My back\" (Exodus 33:23), was carried out in deed."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra cites '(פ׳ יב)' — likely a corrupted or mistaken reference to Exodus 33:12 (the section beginning 'See, you say to me'); translated the citation as he gives it."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:02.152261176Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}